.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Traffic logging","type":"heading","anchor":"Traffic-logging"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"warning","type":"aside","name":"Warning"},{"level":3,"text":"Custom backends","typ